determined by multiplying (1)&nbsp;the Post-Closing Parent Shares by (2)&nbsp;the Company Allocation Percentage. </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
