and its Subsidiaries have taken all commercially reasonable measures to maintain the confidentiality of and protect the proprietary nature of each item of Company Registered IP and otherwise protect and enforce its rights in all information that
constitutes a Trade Secret of the Company or its Subsidiaries, including requiring all </P>
