<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4%; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">(g)&#8195; (i)&nbsp;The Company and its Subsidiaries have taken commercially reasonable steps to protect the confidentiality
