<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4%; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">(d)&#8195;During the preceding three years, (i)&nbsp;neither Parent nor any Subsidiary has effectuated a
